==English==
===Noun===
'''[[horse]] of a [[different]] [[color]]'''
#{{idiom}} An [[unrelated]] or [[irrelevant]] matter; something that has no bearing on the discussion or question.
#:''In another class, you may learn about quantum mechanics, but for describing the path of a baseball, that is a '''horse of a different color'''.''

In ''[[The Wizard of Oz (1939 film)]]'', one of the animals is, literally, a horse of a different color. It is driven by a carriage driver ([[Frank Morgan]]) at the [[Emerald City]], and it literally changes colors from one moment to the next. The colors are highly unlikely, as well - one moment, the horse is purple, another moment it is bright yellow, etc.